                    <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold;">"Failure is an opportunity to grow"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">GROWTH MINDSET</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"I can learn to do anything I want"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"Challenges help me to grow"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"My effort and attitude determine my abilities"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"Feedback is constructive"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"I am inspired by the success of others"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"I like to try new things"</p>
                </div>
                <div style="background-color: #ffebee; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 5px solid #f44336;">
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold;">"Failure is the limit of my abilities"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">FIXED MINDSET</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"I'm either good at it or I'm not"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"My abilities are unchanging"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"I can either do it, or I can't"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"My potential is predetermined"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"When I'm frustrated, I give up"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"Feedback and criticism are personal"</p>
                    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">"I stick to what I know"</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; font-size: 20px;">Promoting a Culture of Failing</p>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 24px;">Growth Mindset vs. Fixed Mindset</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; height: 100%;">
