            <h2 style="font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Confronting with Grace and Accountability</h2>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>Own the Problem (be direct)</li>
                <li>Choose words carefully
                    <ul style="list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 20px;">
                        <li>Sandwich approach</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li>Listen, really listen and show understanding
                    <ul style="list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 20px;">
                        <li>Be open to hearing something you may need to do different.</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li>Negotiate future behavior</li>
